      "content": "TL 00 NE                    ST MICHAEL           WESTWICK ROW                                                  (north east side) 8/312                                            L-shaped range of barns                                                  on S side of farmyard at                                                  Westwick Row Farm GV                                               II Three barns in L group.   Late C18 and C19.   Timber frame. Weatherboarding.   Plain tile roofs with slate roof  lean-to additions.  SE barn is 6 bays.  Clasped purlin roof. Red brick base with plinth.  Return barn along road is probably same date and construction.  To NW is a mid C19 single storey barn in flint with red brick dressings. Listing NGR: TL0936006568"
    }
